<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίψ</span></b>  (A), ὁ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the SW. wind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				364b2
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				9.11
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.10.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the South</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">LXX,
					<u>Ge.</u>13.14</span></i>, al.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>the West</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηλιώτης</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				14.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				8.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>A.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.21.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.49.45
			</span></i>; rarely in <i><span class="en">LXX, <u>2
				Ch.</u>32.30</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				33.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>Da.</u>
				8.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβός</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβα εἰς ἀπηλιώτην</span> from
			<u>West</u> to East, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1037.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPR</u>
				28.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Astron., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωινὸς λ., μεσημβρινὸς λ.,
				ὀψινὸς λ.</span>, <i>position</i> of a star <i>on the W.
				horizon</i> at sunrise, midday, or sunset, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>.</div>
